        <h3 class="text-center" style="color: #973aae;">About the episode</h3>
        <div class="col-md-12 text-justify"><p>The immersive episode gives an interesting opportunity to look at the evolution of bulb in the new light and covers the inspiring journey of Syska becoming a thought leader brand in the LED light segment by capturing sharp customer insights, by introducing innovative products, by implementing aggressive marketing strategies and everything in between.  Next few minutes will help in switching ON your imagination to aspire and bask in 16 million light colours from just one Wi-Fi enabled smart bulb witnessing the future of app and voice-assistant controlled lights and turning OFF the age-old myopic approach towards the category.</p></div>
